---
import Button from '../components/blocks/Button.astro';
import Embed from '../components/blocks/Embed.astro';
import Img from '../components/blocks/Img.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Shape from '../components/blocks/Shape.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import img26a860b0f from '../assets/images/2-6a860b0f.png';
import img22 from '../assets/images/22.png';
import img53 from '../assets/images/53.png';
import blueIvoryPurpleBlend from '../assets/images/blue-ivory-purple-blend.png';
import gradient2 from '../assets/images/gradient-2.png';
import gradientD81605ea from '../assets/images/gradient-d81605ea.png';
import kaboompicsBeautifulTeenageGirlWithLongBl from '../assets/images/kaboompics-beautiful-teenage-girl-with-long-blonde-hair-wearing-a-pink-jacket-21242.jpg';
import kaboompicsWorkspaceInTheLivingRoom24043 from '../assets/images/kaboompics-workspace-in-the-living-room-24043.jpg';
import pexelsPolinaZimmerman3958385 from '../assets/images/pexels-polina-zimmerman-3958385.jpg';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
---

<Layout title="SEO Consulting for Therapists | HelloSEO" description="Book a personalized SEO Power Hour with HelloSEO to improve your website's visibility. Get tailored guidance and actionable next steps for your practice." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0} headerTheme="white">
  <Section theme="white" bg={{ src: blueIvoryPurpleBlend, eager: true }} grid={{ rows: [21, 18], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="2/2/17/10" d="4/6/13/22" z={2} align="center">
      <p class="large ta-center"><strong>STRATEGY SESSION</strong></p>
      <h2 class="ta-center">You shouldn't have to teach your <span class="c-lightAccent">marketing partner</span> what a caseload is or explain the boundaries of ethical advertising.</h2>
      <p class="large ta-center">When you book a strategy session with HelloSEO, you get actionable support from a team who understands your profession. The entire hour is dedicated to answering your questions <br>instead of relying on you to provide context. </p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="18/2/20/10" d="14/11/16/17" z={5} align="center" href="/seo-power-hour#schedule-session">Schedule Your 60-minute Strategy Session</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section height="medium" grid={{ rows: [48, 19], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="1/2/9/10" d="11/21/20/26" z={6} zm={4} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={pexelsPolinaZimmerman3958385} alt="A person with a bracelet on their wrist taking notes in a notebook. In the background, two people sitting on a couch, one man and one woman, are blurred out." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 21vw" />
    <Text m="10/2/22/10" d="1/3/11/13" z={1}>
      <h2>As a therapist, you know how <span class="c-lightAccent">transformative</span> a single <span class="c-black">session</span> can be.</h2>
      <p class="large">The right questions lead to breakthrough answers, which is exactly why our Strategy Sessions are completely tailored to your practice. We’ll talk through your specific concerns and questions so you can feel confident making critical visibility decisions.&nbsp;</p>
      <p class="large"><strong>One-time investment: $299</strong></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="23/2/39/10" d="1/14/11/26" z={4} zm={2} align="center" alignM="start" bg="var(--accent)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h3>Strategy Sessions Include:&nbsp;</h3>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p>A personalized review of your website's SEO and AEO performance</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Expert guidance tailored to your practice goals</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Answers to all your SEO and AI search questions in a judgment-free space</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Clarity on why your website may not be attracting your ideal clients</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>Actionable recommendations you can implement right away</p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p>A prioritized roadmap so you know exactly what to tackle, in what order</p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </Text>
    <Text m="39/2/49/10" d="11/14/20/21" z={5} zm={3} align="center" alignM="start" bg="var(--mauve)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px" bulletColor="#fff4eb" bulletIcon={img26a860b0f}>
      <h3><span class="c-white">Ideal If You Are:</span></h3>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p><span class="c-white">Launching or expanding your practice</span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><span class="c-white">Refreshing your website</span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><span class="c-white">Wondering why inquiries have stalled</span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><span class="c-white">Expanding your areas of specialty</span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p><span class="c-white">Looking for expert guidance before committing to ongoing SEO services</span></p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" height="small" grid={{ rows: [17, 9], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Shape m="3/2/17/10" d="1/3/10/25" z={1} align="center" fill="var(--accent)" stroke={{ color: 'var(--darkAccent)', width: '15px' }} radius="30px" />
    <Img m="1/2/4/10" d="3/23/7/26" z={3} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 4, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }] }] }} src={gradient2} alt="Illustration of a smiling cat with closed eyes and curled tail, dark background." fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 13vw" />
    <Text m="4/3/16/9" d="2/5/9/21" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h3>“I had no idea how helpful just one hour could be for my SEO needs.</h3>
      <p>Jade has a streamlined process of delivering what you need in a speedy and effective way. I had no idea what the backend of my website needed to be more authoritative, and now it will be! I'm grateful for her expertise and swiftness.”</p>
      <p class="large"><strong>- SARAH A.</strong></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section height="medium" grid={{ rows: [55, 24], rowGap: 11, colGap: 35 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/3/10" d="1/10/3/18" z={1}>
      <h2 class="ta-center">How It Works</h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="3/2/7/10" d="3/8/5/20" z={2}>
      <p class="large ta-center">Book a session below, leave with confidence, clarity, and a customized plan to help more of the right clients find you online.&nbsp;</p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="7/2/22/10" d="6/2/22/10" z={3} align="center" origin="0% 50%" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="7/2/13/10" d="6/2/12/10" z={13} zm={10} align="center" src={kaboompicsWorkspaceInTheLivingRoom24043} alt="A brown leather tufted sofa with a white marble-top table nearby. On the sofa, there is a planner with a silver pen on top. A laptop with a black keyboard is open on the table." focal="42.5% 0%" radius="10px 10px 0px 0px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 33vw" />
    <Text m="14/3/21/9" d="13/3/19/9" z={4}>
      <h3><span class="c-white">Step One:&nbsp;</span><br><span class="c-white">Schedule Your Session&nbsp;</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">Use the calendar below to select a time and date that works best for you. Can’t find something that works? No worries. </span><a href="/contact"><span class="c-white">Reach out to us directly</span></a><span class="c-white"> and we’ll make it happen.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="22/2/39/10" d="6/10/22/18" z={4} zm={5} align="center" origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--darkAccent)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="22/2/28/10" d="6/10/12/18" z={14} zm={11} align="center" src={img22} alt="A person working at a white desk with a laptop, notebooks, a pair of glasses, a glass of water, a ceramic vase, and a paper lantern." radius="10px 10px 0px 0px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 33vw" />
    <Text m="29/3/38/9" d="13/11/21/17" z={5} zm={6}>
      <h3><span class="c-white">Step Two:&nbsp;</span><br><span class="c-white">Complete Simple Prep</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">While scheduling your session, you’ll be prompted to answer a handful of questions. The more info you can provide, the more efficient we can be on the call. We’ll also request access to a few things like your website and Google Analytics, which we can tackle together. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="39/2/53/10" d="6/18/22/26" z={5} zm={7} align="center" origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--mauve)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="39/2/45/10" d="6/18/12/26" z={15} zm={12} align="center" src={kaboompicsBeautifulTeenageGirlWithLongBl} alt="A young woman with long, wavy blonde hair smiling and holding her head with her right hand, wearing a pink jacket and a white top, standing against a light-colored background." radius="10px 10px 0px 0px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 33vw" />
    <Text m="46/3/52/9" d="13/19/19/25" z={6} zm={8}>
      <h3><span class="c-white">Step Three:&nbsp;</span><br><span class="c-white">Come As You Are</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">Join the call ready to for a candid but upbeat discussion on how to take your visibility to the next level. We can’t wait to meet you!</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="54/2/56/10" d="23/11/25/17" z={11} zm={9} align="center" href="/seo-power-hour#schedule-session">Schedule Your Session</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" grid={{ rows: [25, 14], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Shape m="3/2/24/10" d="3/3/15/25" z={1} align="center" fill="var(--darkAccent)" stroke={{ color: 'var(--mauve)', width: '15px' }} radius="30px" />
    <Img m="1/2/4/10" d="2/1/5/5" z={3} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 4, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }] }] }} src={gradientD81605ea} alt="Flat design illustration of a happy, smiling cat face with closed eyes, pointing ears, and a curled tail against a purple background." fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 17vw" />
    <Text m="4/3/24/9" d="5/6/13/22" z={2} alignM="center">
      <h3><span class="c-white">“Having a Strategy Session with HelloSEO was an absolute game changer for my business.</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">Jade’s approach is incredibly personalized, and she meets you exactly where you are, breaking things down in a way that makes sense for your business, not just in theory. This wasn’t just “here’s what SEO is,” it was “here’s exactly how to use it to grow your business.” I walked away with clarity, direction, and a plan I could immediately put into action.</span></p>
      <p><span class="c-white">On top of that, they bring such a supportive, encouraging energy to her work. If SEO has ever felt overwhelming or confusing, Jade is the person you want guiding you through it. Highly recommend.”</span></p>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white"><strong>- SARAH P.</strong></span></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section height="small" grid={{ rows: [8, 21], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/3/10" d="2/8/5/20" z={1} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center">Book Your Strategy Session</h2>
    </Text>
    <Embed m="3/2/9/10" d="5/5/22/23" z={2}>
      <div class="calendly-inline-widget" data-url="https://calendly.com/helloseo-jade/helloseo-power-hour" style="min-width:320px;height:700px;"></div>
      <script type="text/javascript" src="https://assets.calendly.com/assets/external/widget.js" async=""></script>
    </Embed>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="light-bold" bg={{ src: img53, overlay: 0.63 }} grid={{ rows: [14, 11], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="3/2/11/10" d="4/3/9/16" z={2} align="end" alignM="start">
      <h2><span class="c-white">Support that makes </span><span class="c-accent">you feel seen</span></h2>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white">As SEO experts, it's our job to make sure your website gets found. As humans, it's our job to make sure you feel supported. At HelloSEO, you never have to choose between expertise and human connection.&nbsp;</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="11/2/13/10" d="7/19/9/25" z={3} align="center" href="/done-for-you-seo-aeo">Explore Our Ongoing Services</Button>
  </Section>
</Layout>
